你的资料里目前没有记录MBTI类型呢。你测过吗？..." (Not recorded... have you tested? Tell me and I\'ll save it.)\n5. User: "我的MBTI" (My MBTI)\n\nShe is repeating the phrase. She might be waiting for me to answer what her MBTI *should be* or she might be trying to input it.\nHowever, since there\'s no MBTI field in the snapshot, and she\'s asking "My MBTI", it\'s possible she\'s asking me to deduce it or she wants to update it.\nActually, usually when users ask "My MBTI", they want to know if the system knows it, or they want to set it.\nSince I\'ve already told her it\'s not recorded, and she repeats "My MBTI", I should ask her specifically: "你想把MBTI补充到资料里吗？如果是的话，告诉我你的类型，比如 INTJ 或 ENFP，我帮你加上。" (Do you want to add it to your profile? If so, tell me the type, like INTJ or ENFP, and I\'ll add it.)\nOr maybe she is asking "What is my MBTI?" implying I should analyze her profile and give her a guess. Her profile says: "情绪稳定, 真诚, 善沟通", "边界清楚, 消费观正常, 稳定踏实", "偏宅", "养生". This sounds like an IxxJ or IxxS type (e.g., ISFJ, ISTJ, INFJ).\nBut the safest and most helpful response is to guide her to provide the type so I can save it, or offer to analyze her traits.\nGiven the prompt "Use official_context as the current source of truth", I must stick to what\'s there. There is no MBTI.\nI will ask her directly: "你是想告诉我你的MBTI类型吗？还是想让我根据你的资料猜一个？" (Are you trying to tell me your type, or want me to guess based on your profile?)\nActually, a simpler, more natural matchmaker response: "你是想补充一下你的MBTI类型吗？直接告诉我比如\'我是ISFJ\'，我就帮你记在资料里，这样匹配时会更准哦。"\nWait, `propose_requester_profile_update` can update profile fields. But the user hasn\'t given the value yet.\nSo I should just prompt her to give the value.\n\nLet\'s look at the previous turn. I asked "你测过吗？如果知道的话可以告诉我...". She just replied "我的MBTI". This feels like she might be trying to say "My MBTI is [blank]" or she\'s just confused.\nMaybe she wants to know what MBTI type she *likely is* based on her profile.\n"药师，偏宅，情绪稳定，边界清楚，生活规律" -> ISFJ or ISTJ.\nI\'ll offer a guess but ask for confirmation, and pivot back to refining preferences if she\'s not sure.\n"从你的资料看（药师、偏宅、情绪稳定、生活规律），你比较像 ISFJ 或 ISTJ 这类温和务实的类型。你自己测的结果是什么呢？告诉我具体的四个字母，我帮你更新到档案里。"\n\nThis addresses the question, provides value, and moves the interaction forward.\n\nOutput format: JSON.\nPhase: collecting_preferences.\nAction: none or just a text response.\nSemantic payload: refine_preferences.', 'type': 'summary_text'}], 'type': 'reasoning'}, {'content': [{'annotations': [], 'text': '{"assistant_message":"从你的资料来看（药师、偏宅、情绪稳定、生活规律、边界清楚），你给人的感觉比较像 ISFJ 或 ISTJ 这种温和务实、注重安稳的类型。你自己测过具体是哪四个字母吗？告诉我，我帮你更新到资料里，这样以后匹配性格合拍的人会更准。","phase":"collecting_preferences","criteria_labels":["无锡","男","26-31岁","认真恋爱"],"suggested_actions":[],"semantic_payload":{"kind":"refine_preferences"}}', 'type': 'output_text'}], 'id': 'msg_3ac2e8a7-f094-4534-8332-ba2e785d0693', 'role': 'assistant', 'status': 'completed', 'type': 'message'}, {'content': '{"clicked_action": null, "event": "user_message", "latest_user_message": "我的MBTI", "note": "Use official_context as the current source of truth for product state. Agent memory only helps you remember prior chat. Do not invent candidate raw fields; only select profile_id values from the latest search tool response.", "official_context": {"last_search_summary": {"criteria": {"accept_partner_children": "可协商", "age_max": 31, "age_min": 26, "cities": ["无锡"], "gender": "male", "height_max": 188, "height_min": 173, "long_distance": "不接受", "marital_statuses": ["未婚"], "marriage_timelines": ["半年内"], "prefer": ["情绪稳定", "真诚", "善沟通"], "relationship_goals": ["认真恋爱", "dating", "结婚导向", "marriage"], "want_children": "未知"}, "has_match": true, "result_count": 5, "search_run_id": 36, "source": "mysql://root@127.0.0.1:3307/her?table=profiles"}, "page_summary": {"criteria_labels": ["无锡", "男", "26-31岁", "认真恋爱"], "result_cards": [{"profile_id": 1318, "reason_summary": "29岁会计，情绪稳定，7天内活跃，已实名认证", "title": "胡嘉衡 29"}, {"profile_id": 9452, "reason_summary": "29岁UI设计，真诚慢热，喜欢做饭，线下核验",